    Connecting to central
    database... Success.



    [IDENTITY VERIFICATION]

    User ID: T4-8920

    Department:
    Deep Dive Division

    Clearance Level: Red



    [MISSION BRIEF]

    Objective:
    ENV-105 "Tremor Sea"

    Threat Level: Extreme (Cognitohazard / High Pressure)



    [MESSAGE
    FROM COMMAND]

    "T4-8920, drones are unable to transmit footage from below
    3000 meters.

    We''ve detected a pulse signal. From the seafloor.

    It''s
    alive.



    Your mission is simple: go down, take a look, then come back alive
    to report."



    [STATUS]

    Hatch locked.

    Oxygen supply nominal.

    Dive
    sequence initiated...'
