--- !u!114 &1271306128
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1271306127}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e424a3e3d60c3304684245c223fdca8b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  printerName: XP-80C
  maxPrinterWidth: 576
  title: Manual
  content: '[CENTER] [BOLD] A.I.A.

    [CENTER] DEEP SEA OPERATIONS DIV.

    ORDER
    ID: OP-N-7734 CLEARANCE: TOP

    [BOLD] TO: OPERATOR [T4-8942]


    You have
    been deployed in the DSV-4 unit. External conditions are critical. Visual navigation
    is impossible. This printout is your manual. Do not lose it.


    ==========================================

    [CENTER]
    [INVERSE] CONTROL SYSTEMS

    [BOLD] 1. THRUST (The Lever)

    INPUT: Vertical
    Axis

    ACTION: 2Dl movement.

    WARNING: Inertia is active. The vessel

    will
    drift after input ceases.

    Calculate braking distance.


    [BOLD] 2. YAW
    (The Wheel)

    INPUT: Rotary Valve

    ACTION: Adjusts heading/bearing.


    [BOLD]
    3. STROBE (Red Button)

    ACTION: High-intensity external flash.

    USE:
    Only at [TARGET COORDINATES].


    ==========================================

    [CENTER]
    [INVERSE] NAV & SURVIVAL

    [BOLD] >> BLIND NAV PROTOCOL <<

    You have no
    windows. You have data.


    [A] COORDINATES (X, Y)

    The numbers on your
    screen are your only anchor. Cross-reference with your physical chart.


    [B]
    PROXIMITY (Sensors)

    Center screen values indicate distance to solid mass.


    GREEN:
    Clear

    RED: IMPACT IMMINENT

    If values drop rapidly, REVERSE.

    [C]
    HULL INTEGRITY

    The hull can sustain limited trauma. Structural failure results
    in implosion within 0.03 seconds. A.I.A. is not liable for burial costs.


    ==========================================

    [CENTER]
    [BOLD] MISSION OBJECTIVE

    Navigate to the "ANOMALY" marked on your map. Upon
    arrival, engage STROBE to capture visual data.


    [CENTER] A.I.A.

    [CENTER]
    "Discovery at Any Cost."'
  testImage: {fileID: 0}
  useCustomDate: 1
  customDate: 1979-12-4
  dateFormat: yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss
